Hello everyone :-) Bringing another long-requested feature: key rebindings.

It is now possible to rebind the JUMP, DODGE, SPRINT, HEAVY ATTACK and TOGGLE 1/2 HAND MODE keys in the settings menu. This is currently only implemented for keyboard. If there is a desire from the playerbase for gamepad rebinding support, I'll add it as well in the future. :)

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44662009/199076cb7596e41efaa66653da13484a6ed72171.png[/img]

I hope this brings users more comfort in how they wish to play the game.

Additionaly, here's more bug fixes for things I've found or thought were unbalanced:

[list]
[*] Increased coins for the The Hive Initiative, Celes, Molok, and Orc Xaman and Warrior boss fights;
[*] Improved trigger size for gold coins, making them easier to collect;
[*] Fixed quest tracking for the King's Quest after speaking with Mom;
[*] Enhanced Kyle's posture for a better boss fight experience;
[*] Disabled Frostynax Dragon attack particles still being active even after his death;
[*] Fixed a bug where the arena in Arun Village would continue running after leaving the bounds;
[*] Corrected equipment tooltips to display the correct stats bonus labels;
[/list]

And that's it for today. Thank you again for all the feedback and support.

Cheers!

Hey there, everyone! 😊 Small update today with some new exciting content and bug fixes!

[previewyoutube=9PH4UjMe3Ek;full][/previewyoutube]

Additions:
[list]
[*] Added 2 new weapons: a lance and a longsword, the Flamberge.
[*] Added a new armor set: the golden warrior armor. Find it after leaving your home to join the king's army;
[*] Added two ladders in Mountainpass near the bonfire to be easier to get to other areas in that map;
[*] Updated game credits;
[/list]

Bug fixes:
[list]
[*] Fixed achivements not being awarded because of Steam Manager being destroyed after leaving Cacildes Home. Achievements should be working now!
[*] Fixed null pointers reported by users (thank you!)
[*] Fixed a bug where some enemies who have teleport abilities where not reapparing when taking damage between the teleport transition state;
[*] Fixed a bug where the bear would not initiate battle with the player;
[*] Fixed a bug where player would not receive all the armor sets (boots were not being added in a lot of chests);
[*] Fixed a bug where player would lose key items upon reloading a save game;
[*] Fixed a bug where player would lose gauntlets upon reloading a save game;
[*] Fixed a bug where Vagabond Armor would turn player invisible;
[*] Fixed a bug where the Samurai in Bear Cavern would stay idle and not initiate battle;
[*] Fixed a bug where weapons in two hand mode were in the wrong position.
[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44662009/a411c5a7b0f888b358de92024ee5eb060ab4586d.png[/img]

Thank you for your patience and feedback!

Cheers!
